The optional voice input downloads whisper.cpp (MIT, https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp)
and a Whisper model (MIT, https://huggingface.co/ggerganov/whisper.cpp) at the user's request;
they are not part of this distribution.

The optional voice output downloads Piper (MIT, https://github.com/rhasspy/piper) and Piper voices
(https://huggingface.co/rhasspy/piper-voices; each voice under its own license, see its MODEL_CARD)
at the user's request; they are not part of this distribution. PDF pages are rendered with pdf.js
(Apache-2.0, https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js). Pictures of PowerPoint slides are made by Microsoft
PowerPoint when it is installed on the user's computer.

